# RalliSport Challenge 2 (4D530039, PAL ISO), Nova and Thor. DRAFT by
# lane.routeprep, 2026-09-26, not played. One file: the profile step is
# [guess], and a later run whose profile list is not empty would highlight
# the saved profile, which A also takes.
#
# Evidence: gamecheck hands-off 240 s (1790364698-gamecheck-354879, Nova,
# ~2.4 s per frame): f06 the RSC2 logo, f10 Microsoft Game Studios, f14-f50
# the intro FMV (rally cars), f54-f74 the title "PRESS START TO BEGIN"
# (~130-180 s), f78-f98 attract replays. Nothing past the title is on disk.
#
# Past the title [recalled, low]: a profile screen (create a new profile with
# a name keyboard), then the main menu with Career first and a single race
# below it; a single race picks a discipline, a track and a car.
wait 45
shot boot45
press START                 # [guess] try to skip the intro FMV
wait 30
shot boot75
wait 55
shot boot130                # expect PRESS START TO BEGIN [seen f54]
mark booted
press START
wait 8
shot after-title            # OPEN: profile screen / storage prompt
press A                     # [guess] create new profile (or the saved one)
wait 6
shot keyboard
press START                 # [guess] accept the default name
wait 6
shot after-keyboard
press A                     # [guess] confirm / save
wait 8
shot main-menu
mark profile-ready
axis LY max                 # [guess] down from Career to a single race
wait 0.15
axis LY mid
wait 0.6
shot on-single
press A
wait 6
shot discipline
press A
wait 6
shot track
press A
wait 6
shot car
press A
wait 6
shot confirm
press A
wait 30
shot loading
wait 10
shot start
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the first frame with the car moving under RT
repeat forever {
    axis RT max
    axis LX min
    wait 1.5
    axis LX max
    wait 1.5
    axis LX mid
    wait 3
}
